WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.369
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:06.339
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.640
Well, guys, today,

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.708
President Trump
visited a town in Texas

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.244
to mark the completion

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:14.380
of the more than 400 miles
of border wall.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.049
When they heard Trump
was coming to the border,

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.718
Mexico was like, "Whew!
Thank God that wall is here."

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.586
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:23.289
Yeah, what a time to celebrate
the effectiveness of a wall --

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.325
six days after this happened.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:28.027
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:30.163
You know
your presidency is off the rails

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.098
when you have to distract
from your attempted coup

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.467
with your giant symbol
of racism.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.336
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:38.838
But this was interesting -- when
asked what he was doing there,

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:41.541
Trump said,
"I'm just planning my escape.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.609
That seems like a good route."

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:47.513
Meanwhile, the wall only covers
20% of the U.S.-Mexico border.

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:49.048
20%.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.383
Let me ask you a question.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:53.319
If you ordered a pizza
and only got 1 1/2 slices,

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.722
would you have
a good Yelp review of there?

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.757
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:01.327
Yep, Trump visited the border
in the town of Alamo, Texas.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:04.063
He was like, "Thanks to me,
everyone will remember Alamo."

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:06.332
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.501
In the end, Trump didn't finish
building the wall,

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.103
and Mexico never paid for it,

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.238
but other than that,
pretty good.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.640
Pretty good.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.441
[ Laughter and applause ]
You guys having fun?

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:16.943
You guys having a good time?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.177
Great.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:19.512
[ Applause ]

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:20.946
While Trump was at the border,

00:01:20.946 --> 00:01:22.982
he engaged in one
of his favorite traditions

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.551
and signed
a section of the wall.

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:25.585
Watch this.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.789 line:0%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:31.091 line:0%
Yeah.

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:34.427 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:38.097
Trump was like, "Okay, wall,
you're now officially pardoned."

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:39.799
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.601
Right now,
writing on his border wall

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.569
is the only place
where Trump's allowed to post.

00:01:43.569 --> 00:01:46.873
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:49.242
♪♪

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:50.743
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:59.084
♪♪

00:01:59.084 --> 00:02:01.720
So that's two crimes he's
committed in the past week --

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.856
incitement of a riot
and graffiti.

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:05.191
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:07.326
Times are tough
for Trump right now.

00:02:07.326 --> 00:02:08.594
After he defaced the wall,

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:11.097
he was sent to live with
his auntie and uncle in Bel Air.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:13.466
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.134
Before leaving
to go visit the wall,

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:16.335
Trump spoke to reporters

00:02:16.335 --> 00:02:17.903
and was asked about the riot
at the Capitol.

00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:19.338
And listen to this.

00:02:19.338 --> 00:02:21.174 line:0%
[ Engine rumbling ]

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:27.380 line:0%
-So if you read my speech --
and many people have done it --

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.283 line:0%
it's been analyzed,
and people thought that

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:33.819 line:0%
what I said
was totally appropriate.

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:35.455
-I just got to quote Seinfeld
and say,

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:41.193
"Who are these people?!
Who are these people?!"

00:02:41.193 --> 00:02:42.595
"They're the people of the..."

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:45.031
"Who are these people?!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:46.999
By the way, that wasn't a jet
engine in the background --

00:02:46.999 --> 00:02:49.702
that was 300 million Americans
sighing at the same time.

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:51.170
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.539
And this is big -- last night,
Trump and Vice President Pence

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:55.808
met in person
inside the Oval Office,

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:59.879
marking the first time they had
spoken since last week's riot.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:03.148
Things quickly got off to an
awkward start when Trump said,

00:03:03.148 --> 00:03:06.386
"So, I think
someone owes me an apology."

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:08.921
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.921 --> 00:03:10.556
Yeah, we've all been
in Pence's shoes, though.

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:11.724
You know what I mean?

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:13.326
That uncomfortable meeting
with your boss

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:16.529
after he sent a crazed mob of
vengeful rioters to zip-tie you.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.931
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.931 --> 00:03:22.868
[ Applause ]

00:03:22.868 --> 00:03:23.970
But Trump tried to make nice.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.338
He even gave Pence

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:27.606
a "Sorry I almost got you
killed" meat and cheese platter

00:03:27.606 --> 00:03:28.908
from Harry &amp; David.

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:32.311
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.311 --> 00:03:34.781
I never saw that in that bill --
pamphlet I got there.

00:03:34.781 --> 00:03:36.449
Well, speaking
of the Vice President,

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:38.785 line:0%
earlier tonight,
the House voted on a resolution

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:41.955 line:0%
urging Pence to
invoke the 25th Amendment.

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:43.389
It's a tough choice for Pence --

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:46.024
invoke the 25th
and have MAGA Nation hate you,

00:03:46.024 --> 00:03:49.295
or refuse and still
have MAGA Nation hate you.

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:50.763
You could tell
Pence was nervous

00:03:50.763 --> 00:03:52.664
'cause he spent all day
slamming milks

00:03:52.664 --> 00:03:54.467
like it was Friday at 5:00 p.m.

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:57.503
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.503 --> 00:04:00.506
Yeah, Mike Pence is being called
on to invoke the 25th Amendment,

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:01.774
and Trump is not happy.

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:03.409
But I'm not sure
Trump understands

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.211
what the 25th Amendment
actually does.

00:04:05.211 --> 00:04:08.247
To be honest, I'm not sure if he
knows what most amendments do.

00:04:08.247 --> 00:04:11.884
For example --
-Oh, here we go.

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:14.520
-Tariq, what's up?
-Let me guess --

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.788
you're gonna make fun of Trump

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:18.424
for not knowing what
any of the amendments mean.

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:20.693
-I mean, yeah, that was --
that was the plan.

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:24.130
-And each joke, it'll pop up,
like, as a graphic,

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.966
so that everyone can see it
and laugh about it.

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:29.902
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:33.005
-Right. Right.
I do -- I do comedy.

00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:34.907
-I know exactly
how this will go down.

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:37.876
So, the top of the screen will
say the name of the amendment,

00:04:37.876 --> 00:04:39.345
like the First Amendment,

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:42.015
and then under that, you'll say
what Trump thinks it means,

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:44.584
like he thinks
the First Amendment is...

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:47.853
[ Laughter ]
Or -- Or you'll show

00:04:47.853 --> 00:04:49.188
the Fifth Amendment,

00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:50.957
and Trump knows that one as...

00:04:53.625 --> 00:04:55.127
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:55.127 --> 00:04:56.329
-And then -- then you do, like,

00:04:56.329 --> 00:04:57.630
the Seventh Amendment
or something.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.366
And Trump --
he thinks that one is...

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.504
-Ohh!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:04.504 --> 00:05:06.138
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:05:06.138 --> 00:05:08.641
-And then you'll finish it off
with the 25th Amendment,

00:05:08.641 --> 00:05:10.610
which Trump thinks is...

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:12.645
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:15.447
-Is -- Is -- Is that
how it's going to go?

00:05:15.447 --> 00:05:17.850
-Uh, yeah. You nailed it.
[ Chuckles ]

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:20.186
-Seems like a fun bit.
You should do it.

00:05:20.186 --> 00:05:22.922
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:25.525
[ Applause ]

00:05:30.162 --> 00:05:31.998
-Great, we'll do it tomorrow.

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.332
-Looking forward to it.

00:05:33.332 --> 00:05:36.001
[ Laughter ]

00:05:36.001 --> 00:05:37.470
-Well, lots of people

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.371
are distancing themselves
from the President,

00:05:39.371 --> 00:05:42.041
including New England Patriots
head coach Bill Belichick.

00:05:42.041 --> 00:05:43.442
Last night, he said

00:05:43.442 --> 00:05:46.813 line:0%
he won't accept the Presidential
Medal of Freedom from Trump.

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:48.814 line:0%
Yep. It was a hard decision
for the coach.

00:05:48.814 --> 00:05:51.016
I heard he bought
a new hooded, sleeveless tuxedo

00:05:51.016 --> 00:05:52.018
for the occasion.

00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:53.719
[ Laughter ]

00:05:53.719 --> 00:05:56.355
Here's some good news --
yesterday, Governor Cuomo vowed

00:05:56.355 --> 00:05:59.392
that New York will legalize
recreational marijuana.

00:05:59.392 --> 00:06:04.229
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:04.229 --> 00:06:05.965
Great job.

00:06:05.965 --> 00:06:08.267
New Yorkers have spent
almost a year with nothing to do

00:06:08.267 --> 00:06:09.835
but sit at home
and watch Netflix.

00:06:09.835 --> 00:06:11.403
Now you legalize weed?

00:06:11.403 --> 00:06:13.772
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:13.772 --> 00:06:17.209
"Who are these people?!"

00:06:17.209 --> 00:06:19.078
I think New York is ready
for legal weed.

00:06:19.078 --> 00:06:20.445
Just look at
the Statue of Liberty.

00:06:20.445 --> 00:06:23.181
Our most famous symbol
is green, wearing a bathrobe,

00:06:23.181 --> 00:06:24.450
and holding up a lighter.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.985
[ Laughter ]

00:06:26.985 --> 00:06:28.253
Some entertainment news --

00:06:28.253 --> 00:06:30.155
during last night's episode
of "The Bachelor,"

00:06:30.155 --> 00:06:32.525
the women played a game called
"Capture the Heart."

00:06:32.525 --> 00:06:33.893
And one contestant, Victoria,

00:06:33.893 --> 00:06:36.295
had an interesting way of
describing the other team.

00:06:36.295 --> 00:06:37.497
Listen to this.

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:43.236 line:0%
-Whoo!

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:46.438
[ Laughter ]

00:06:46.438 --> 00:06:48.306
-Gestures?

00:06:48.306 --> 00:06:52.411
"And, Matt, he's like
a K-night of the Round Table."

00:06:52.411 --> 00:06:55.281
[ Laughter ]

00:06:55.281 --> 00:06:57.250
Later in the episode,
there was some drama

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.151
between Victoria
and another contestant.

00:06:59.151 --> 00:07:01.120
And Victoria tried to say that
they don't mix well,

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.355
like oil and water,

00:07:02.355 --> 00:07:04.090
but, instead, she said this.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.962 line:0%
-Yeah, and I think
that we can --

00:07:11.631 --> 00:07:13.399
[ Laughter ]

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:17.370
[ Applause ]

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.672
-Actually,
that goes pretty well together.

00:07:19.672 --> 00:07:26.178
"I mean, we're like
peanut butter and...jelly?"

00:07:26.178 --> 00:07:28.681
[ Laughter ]

00:07:28.681 --> 00:07:30.015
You could tell
her face was like,

00:07:30.015 --> 00:07:31.416
"I don't think this is right,"

00:07:31.416 --> 00:07:34.186
but her mouth was like,
"Nope, I'm going for it, yeah."

00:07:34.186 --> 00:07:36.355
[ Laughter ]
We're laughing,

00:07:36.355 --> 00:07:38.624
but tomorrow, she's getting the
Presidential Medal of Freedom.

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:40.292
That amazing?
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:40.292 --> 00:07:41.661
Isn't that amazing?

00:07:41.661 --> 00:07:43.696
[ Applause ]

00:07:43.696 --> 00:07:45.664
And finally,
I saw that Ben &amp; Jerry's

00:07:45.664 --> 00:07:49.134
has started selling
its own frozen dog treats.

00:07:49.134 --> 00:07:51.170
Trust me, once weed
becomes legal in New York,

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.705
that'll be just ice cream.

00:07:52.705 --> 00:07:53.973
What a show we have
for you tonight --

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:57.309
she stars in the new movie
"Locked Down" on HBO Max.

00:07:57.309 --> 00:07:59.545
Anne Hathaway is here tonight!

00:07:59.545 --> 00:08:02.148
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:03.749
Plus, she's the host of

00:08:03.749 --> 00:08:05.951
"A Little Late with Lilly Singh"
on NBC --

00:08:05.951 --> 00:08:07.887
Lilly Singh is here!

00:08:07.887 --> 00:08:09.555
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:09.555 --> 00:08:13.192
And we got great music
from Jazmine Sullivan!

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:16.529
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:16.529 --> 00:08:18.731
Be sure to tune in
tomorrow night --

00:08:18.731 --> 00:08:21.066
Riz Ahmed and Angela Bassett
will be here.

00:08:21.066 --> 00:08:23.235
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:23.235 --> 00:08:25.404
And we got an all--
we got an all-new

00:08:25.404 --> 00:08:26.405
"Freestylin' with The Roots."

00:08:26.405 --> 00:08:27.707
You guys excited to do that one?

00:08:27.707 --> 00:08:30.643
-Uh. Yeah, yeah.

00:08:30.643 --> 00:08:32.511
-Sure.

00:08:32.511 --> 00:08:33.946
-Yup.

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:35.548
-Nasty.

00:08:35.548 --> 00:08:40.252
[ Laughter ]

00:08:40.252 --> 00:08:42.554
-Well, it's a fun bit.
Anyway...

00:08:42.554 --> 00:08:44.723
You guys have a good day today?

00:08:44.723 --> 00:08:46.058
-Pretty good. Yeah.

00:08:46.058 --> 00:08:47.693
-It was fine.

00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:49.995
-Yeah. Same.

00:08:49.995 --> 00:08:51.464
-Nasty.

00:08:51.464 --> 00:08:53.666
[ Laughter ]

00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:55.635
[ Applause ]

00:08:55.635 --> 00:08:57.403
-I had a good day --
I had a good day, too.

00:08:57.403 --> 00:08:59.938
Did you guys have anything good
for lunch or anything?

00:08:59.938 --> 00:09:02.742
-Um, no, not really.

00:09:02.742 --> 00:09:04.010
-The usual.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:08.280
-I microwaved some salmon, so...

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:09.482
-Nasty.

00:09:09.482 --> 00:09:11.316
[ Laughter ]

00:09:11.316 --> 00:09:13.152
-Well, everyone should...

00:09:13.152 --> 00:09:15.287
[ Laughter ]

00:09:15.287 --> 00:09:17.189
Everyone should check out
"Freestylin'" tomorrow.

